                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How often should I refresh Meta ads creative?</h3>
                                        <p>Kill under-performing creatives at 3-5x normal frequency. Winning creatives 4-8 weeks. Fresh creative test cycle 1-2 weeks.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest creative fatigue mistake?</h3>
                                        <p>Under-investing in creative pipeline. Bid optimisation matters less than creative volume in 2026-2027 Meta algorithm.</p>
                                        <h3>How many creatives should I test per week?</h3>
                                        <p>Growth-stage: 20-40 fresh creatives per week. Scaling: 50-150 per week. Volume + testing framework combined.</p>
                                        <h3>Is AI-generated creative worth using?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes as variant + scale-multiplier tool. Not as replacement for authentic creator UGC + brand-controlled creative. Combined pipeline works best.</p>
